[{"s":97,"a":5,"en":"Peace it is until the emergence of dawn.","w":[["سَلَٰمٌ","Peace"],["هِيَ","it (is)"],["حَتَّىٰ","until"],["مَطۡلَعِ","(the) emergence"],["ٱلۡفَجۡرِ","(of) the dawn"]]},{"s":108,"a":3,"en":"Indeed, your enemy is the one cut off.","w":[["إِنَّ","Indeed"],["شَانِئَكَ","your enemy"],["هُوَ","he (is)"],["ٱلۡأَبۡتَرُ","the one cut off"]]},{"s":74,"a":8,"en":"And when the trumpet is blown,","w":[["فَإِذَا","Then when"],["نُقِرَ","is blown"],["فِي","in"],["ٱلنَّاقُورِ","the trumpet"]]},{"s":102,"a":4,"en":"Then no! You are going to know.","w":[["ثُمَّ","Then"],["كَلَّا","nay"],["سَوۡفَ","Soon"],["تَعۡلَمُونَ","you will know"]]},{"s":17,"a":52,"en":"On the Day He will call you and you will respond with praise of Him and think that you had not remained [in the world] except for a little.\"","w":[["يَوۡمَ","(On) the Day"],["يَدۡعُوكُمۡ","He will call you"],["فَتَسۡتَجِيبُونَ","and you will respond"],["بِحَمۡدِهِۦ","with His Praise"],["وَتَظُنُّونَ","and you will think"],["إِن","not"],["لَّبِثۡتُمۡ","you had remained"],["إِلَّا","except"],["قَلِيلٗا","a little (while)"]]},{"s":51,"a":21,"en":"And in yourselves. Then will you not see?","w":[["وَفِيٓ","And in"],["أَنفُسِكُمۡۚ","yourselves"],["أَفَلَا","Then will not"],["تُبۡصِرُونَ","you see"]]},{"s":31,"a":4,"en":"Who establish prayer and give zakah, and they, of the Hereafter, are certain [in faith].","w":[["ٱلَّذِينَ","Those who"],["يُقِيمُونَ","establish"],["ٱلصَّلَوٰةَ","the prayer"],["وَيُؤۡتُونَ","and give"],["ٱلزَّكَوٰةَ","zakah"],["وَهُم","and they"],["بِٱلۡأٓخِرَةِ","in the Hereafter"],["هُمۡ","[they]"],["يُوقِنُونَ","believe firmly"]]},{"s":33,"a":46,"en":"And one who invites to Allah, by His permission, and an illuminating lamp.","w":[["وَدَاعِيًا","And as one who invites"],["إِلَى","to"],["ٱللَّهِ","Allah"],["بِإِذۡنِهِۦ","by His permission"],["وَسِرَاجٗا","and (as) a lamp"],["مُّنِيرٗا","illuminating"]]},{"s":41,"a":3,"en":"A Book whose verses have been detailed, an Arabic Qur'an for a people who know,","w":[["كِتَٰبٞ","A Book"],["فُصِّلَتۡ","are detailed"],["ءَايَٰتُهُۥ","its Verses"],["قُرۡءَانًا","a Quran"],["عَرَبِيّٗا","(in) Arabic"],["لِّقَوۡمٖ","for a people"],["يَعۡلَمُونَ","(who) know"]]},{"s":30,"a":5,"en":"In the victory of Allah. He gives victory to whom He wills, and He is the Exalted in Might, the Merciful.","w":[["بِنَصۡرِ","With (the) help"],["ٱللَّهِۚ","(of) Allah"],["يَنصُرُ","He helps"],["مَن","whom"],["يَشَآءُۖ","He wills"],["وَهُوَ","And He"],["ٱلۡعَزِيزُ","(is) the All-Mighty"],["ٱلرَّحِيمُ","the Most Merciful"]]},{"s":16,"a":46,"en":"Or that He would not seize them during their [usual] activity, and they could not cause failure?","w":[["أَوۡ","Or"],["يَأۡخُذَهُمۡ","that He may seize them"],["فِي","in"],["تَقَلُّبِهِمۡ","their going to and fro"],["فَمَا","then not"],["هُم","they"],["بِمُعۡجِزِينَ","will be able to escape"]]},{"s":78,"a":27,"en":"Indeed, they were not expecting an account","w":[["إِنَّهُمۡ","Indeed,they"],["كَانُواْ","were"],["لَا","not"],["يَرۡجُونَ","expecting"],["حِسَابٗا","an account"]]},{"s":14,"a":50,"en":"Their garments of liquid pitch and their faces covered by the Fire.","w":[["سَرَابِيلُهُم","Their garments"],["مِّن","of"],["قَطِرَانٖ","tar"],["وَتَغۡشَىٰ","and will cover"],["وُجُوهَهُمُ","their faces"],["ٱلنَّارُ","the Fire"]]},{"s":79,"a":35,"en":"The Day when man will remember that for which he strove,","w":[["يَوۡمَ","(The) Day"],["يَتَذَكَّرُ","will remember"],["ٱلۡإِنسَٰنُ","man"],["مَا","what"],["سَعَىٰ","he strove (for)"]]},{"s":29,"a":56,"en":"O My servants who have believed, indeed My earth is spacious, so worship only Me.","w":[["يَٰعِبَادِيَ","O My servants"],["ٱلَّذِينَ","who"],["ءَامَنُوٓاْ","believe"],["إِنَّ","Indeed"],["أَرۡضِي","My earth"],["وَٰسِعَةٞ","(is) spacious"],["فَإِيَّـٰيَ","so only"],["فَٱعۡبُدُونِ","worship Me"]]},{"s":49,"a":4,"en":"Indeed, those who call you, [O Muhammad], from behind the chambers - most of them do not use reason.","w":[["إِنَّ","Indeed"],["ٱلَّذِينَ","those who"],["يُنَادُونَكَ","call you"],["مِن","from"],["وَرَآءِ","behind"],["ٱلۡحُجُرَٰتِ","the private chambers"],["أَكۡثَرُهُمۡ","most of them"],["لَا","(do) not"],["يَعۡقِلُونَ","understand"]]},{"s":13,"a":20,"en":"Those who fulfill the covenant of Allah and do not break the contract,","w":[["ٱلَّذِينَ","Those who"],["يُوفُونَ","fulfill"],["بِعَهۡدِ","the covenant"],["ٱللَّهِ","(of) Allah"],["وَلَا","and not"],["يَنقُضُونَ","they break"],["ٱلۡمِيثَٰقَ","the contract"]]},{"s":47,"a":1,"en":"Those who disbelieve and avert [people] from the way of Allah - He will waste their deeds.","w":[["ٱلَّذِينَ","Those who"],["كَفَرُواْ","disbelieve"],["وَصَدُّواْ","and turn away"],["عَن","from"],["سَبِيلِ","(the) way of Allah"],["ٱللَّهِ","(the) way of Allah"],["أَضَلَّ","He will cause to be lost"],["أَعۡمَٰلَهُمۡ","their deeds"]]},{"s":22,"a":24,"en":"And they had been guided [in worldly life] to good speech, and they were guided to the path of the Praiseworthy.","w":[["وَهُدُوٓاْ","And they were guided"],["إِلَى","to"],["ٱلطَّيِّبِ","the good"],["مِنَ","of"],["ٱلۡقَوۡلِ","the speech"],["وَهُدُوٓاْ","and they were guided"],["إِلَىٰ","to"],["صِرَٰطِ","(the) path"],["ٱلۡحَمِيدِ","(of) the Praiseworthy"]]},{"s":94,"a":5,"en":"For indeed, with hardship [will be] ease.","w":[["فَإِنَّ","So indeed"],["مَعَ","with"],["ٱلۡعُسۡرِ","the hardship"],["يُسۡرًا","(is) ease"]]},{"s":99,"a":6,"en":"That Day, the people will depart separated [into categories] to be shown [the result of] their deeds.","w":[["يَوۡمَئِذٖ","That Day"],["يَصۡدُرُ","will proceed"],["ٱلنَّاسُ","the mankind"],["أَشۡتَاتٗا","(in) scattered groups"],["لِّيُرَوۡاْ","to be shown"],["أَعۡمَٰلَهُمۡ","their deeds"]]},{"s":46,"a":19,"en":"And for all there are degrees [of reward and punishment] for what they have done, and [it is] so that He may fully compensate them for their deeds, and they will not be wronged.","w":[["وَلِكُلّٖ","And for all"],["دَرَجَٰتٞ","(are) degrees"],["مِّمَّا","for what"],["عَمِلُواْۖ","they did"],["وَلِيُوَفِّيَهُمۡ","and that He may fully compensate them"],["أَعۡمَٰلَهُمۡ","(for) their deeds"],["وَهُمۡ","and they"],["لَا","will not be wronged"],["يُظۡلَمُونَ","will not be wronged"]]},{"s":48,"a":1,"en":"Indeed, We have given you, [O Muhammad], a clear conquest","w":[["إِنَّا","Indeed"],["فَتَحۡنَا","We have given victory"],["لَكَ","to you"],["فَتۡحٗا","a victory"],["مُّبِينٗا","clear"]]},{"s":38,"a":30,"en":"And to David We gave Solomon. An excellent servant, indeed he was one repeatedly turning back [to Allah].","w":[["وَوَهَبۡنَا","And We gave"],["لِدَاوُۥدَ","to Dawood"],["سُلَيۡمَٰنَۚ","Sulaiman"],["نِعۡمَ","an excellent"],["ٱلۡعَبۡدُ","slave"],["إِنَّهُۥٓ","Indeed,he"],["أَوَّابٌ","(was) one who repeatedly turned"]]},{"s":62,"a":3,"en":"And [to] others of them who have not yet joined them. And He is the Exalted in Might, the Wise.","w":[["وَءَاخَرِينَ","And others"],["مِنۡهُمۡ","among them"],["لَمَّا","who have not yet"],["يَلۡحَقُواْ","joined"],["بِهِمۡۚ","them"],["وَهُوَ","and He"],["ٱلۡعَزِيزُ","(is) the All-Mighty"],["ٱلۡحَكِيمُ","the All-Wise"]]},{"s":101,"a":6,"en":"Then as for one whose scales are heavy [with good deeds],","w":[["فَأَمَّا","Then as for"],["مَن","(him) whose"],["ثَقُلَتۡ","(are) heavy"],["مَوَٰزِينُهُۥ","his scales"]]},{"s":10,"a":91,"en":"Now? And you had disobeyed [Him] before and were of the corrupters?","w":[["ءَآلۡـَٰٔنَ","Now"],["وَقَدۡ","And verily"],["عَصَيۡتَ","you (had) disobeyed"],["قَبۡلُ","before"],["وَكُنتَ","and you were"],["مِنَ","of"],["ٱلۡمُفۡسِدِينَ","the corrupters"]]},{"s":72,"a":26,"en":"[He is] Knower of the unseen, and He does not disclose His [knowledge of the] unseen to anyone","w":[["عَٰلِمُ","(The) All-Knower"],["ٱلۡغَيۡبِ","(of) the unseen"],["فَلَا","so not"],["يُظۡهِرُ","He reveals"],["عَلَىٰ","from"],["غَيۡبِهِۦٓ","His unseen"],["أَحَدًا","(to) anyone"]]},{"s":58,"a":20,"en":"Indeed, the ones who oppose Allah and His Messenger - those will be among the most humbled.","w":[["إِنَّ","Indeed"],["ٱلَّذِينَ","those who"],["يُحَآدُّونَ","oppose"],["ٱللَّهَ","Allah"],["وَرَسُولَهُۥٓ","and His Messenger"],["أُوْلَـٰٓئِكَ","those"],["فِي","(will be) among"],["ٱلۡأَذَلِّينَ","the most humiliated"]]},{"s":3,"a":150,"en":"But Allah is your protector, and He is the best of helpers.","w":[["بَلِ","Nay"],["ٱللَّهُ","Allah"],["مَوۡلَىٰكُمۡۖ","(is) your Protector"],["وَهُوَ","and He"],["خَيۡرُ","(is the) best"],["ٱلنَّـٰصِرِينَ","(of) the Helpers"]]}]